      "sion, loss, and self-phase modulation (gamma)"
      MaskPromptString	      "Number of FFT|Time step (ps)|Distance step (km)|Number of steps (L=nz*dz)|Center wavelen"
      "gth (nm)|Power loss coefficient (dB/km)|Dispersion coefficient (ps/nm.km)|Nonlinear refractive index (m^2/W)|Eff"
      "ective area (m^2)|Max number iterations (default=4)|Convergence tolerance (default=1e-5)|Nonlinear threshold (W)"
      MaskStyleString	      "edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit"
      MaskTunableValueString  "on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on"
      MaskCallbackString      "|||||||||||"
      MaskEnableString	      "on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on"
      MaskVisibilityString    "on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on"
      MaskToolTipString	      "on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on,on"
      MaskVariables	      "nt=@1;dt=@2;dz=@3;nz=@4;lamda0=@5;alpha_indB=@6;D=@7;n2=@8;Aeff=@9;maxiter=@10;tol=@11;P_no"
      "n_thres=@12;"
      MaskIconFrame	      on
